# sysid_thrust_abort_chain.scn — a running thrust excitation is stopped by a cancel, a stick, a low battery and a height error, and the craft keeps hovering
#                              実行中の推力励振が、取り消し・スティック・電池の低下・高さのずれで止まり、機体はホバーを続ける
#
# Four 20 s multisines, each stopped early: (1) `sysid thrust stop` at +3 s -> cancelled; (2) a roll stick movement beyond the guidance-cancel threshold -> stick; (3) the battery held at 3.58 V (below the 3.6 V abort line, above the 3.4 V warning) -> battery; (4) an upward gust of 0.025 N for 1 s that moves the height more than 0.15 m -> height_error. Each abort returns the signal to 0 over 0.25 s and the hover goes on; no run completes.
# 20 s の多重正弦波を 4 回、それぞれ途中で止める: (1) +3 s で `sysid thrust stop` → cancelled、(2) 誘導解除のしきい値を超えるロールスティックの動き → stick、(3) 電池を 3.58 V に保つ（打ち切りの 3.6 V より下、警告の 3.4 V より上）→ battery、(4) 0.025 N の上向きの突風を 1 s、高さが 0.15 m を超えて動く → height_error。どの打ち切りも 0.25 s で信号を 0 に戻し、ホバーは続く。完了する実行はない。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/sysid_thrust_abort_chain.scn --target vehicle --duration 72000000
#
#  <t>  ch  <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz> <alt> <acro> <pos>
   0    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — still calibration (t=0-6)
   +    battery  4.1                                                          # A2: hold the battery at 4.1 V for the whole flight: the SILS battery model sags below the 3.8 V start line after about 40 s of hover, which would refuse the later runs for a reason that is not the one under test
   +    api  "command"                                                        # B: SDK mode
   +    api  "takeoff"                                                        # C: POS_HOLD auto-takeoff -> 0.5 m
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     12000      50                       # D: neutral RC during takeoff + hover (t=6-18)
   +    api  "up 20"                                                          # E: climb to 0.7 m (t=18)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     8000      50                       # F: neutral RC while climbing and settling (t=18-26)
   +    api  "sysid thrust multisine 5 20"                                    # G1: first run (t=26)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     3000      50                       # G2: 3 s of signal (t=26-29)
   +    api  "sysid thrust stop"                                              # G3: cancel (t=29)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     4000      50                       # G4: settle (t=29-33)
   +    api  "sysid thrust multisine 5 20"                                    # H1: second run (t=33)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     3000      50                       # H2: 3 s of signal (t=33-36)
   +    rc   2048  2500   2048    2048  0     1500      50                       # H3: roll stick moved by 0.22 (limit 0.15) (t=36-37.5)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     5000      50                       # H4: sticks back to neutral, settle (t=37.5-42.5)
   +    api  "sysid thrust multisine 5 20"                                    # I1: third run (t=42.5)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     3000      50                       # I2: 3 s of signal (t=42.5-45.5)
   +    battery  3.7                                                          # I3a: battery down to 3.7 V (still above the 3.6 V abort line; a smaller step than 4.1 -> 3.58, so the slow voltage compensation sags the thrust less) (t=45.5)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     500       50                       # I3b: 0.5 s at 3.7 V (t=45.5-46)
   +    battery  3.58                                                         # I3: battery held at 3.58 V, below the 3.6 V abort line for 0.5 s -> battery (t=46)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     2000      50                       # I4: 2 s at 3.58 V (t=46-48)
   +    battery  4.1                                                          # I5: back to 4.1 V (t=48)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     5000      50                       # I6: settle (t=48-53)
   +    api  "sysid thrust multisine 5 20"                                    # J1: fourth run (t=53)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     3000      50                       # J2: 3 s of signal (t=53-56)
   +    wind  0 0 -0.025                                                      # J3: upward force 0.025 N (t=56). No duration: a timed wind event would send no RC for that time and the comm-loss failsafe would land the craft
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     1000      50                       # J3b: 1 s of the force (t=56-57)
   +    wind  0 0 0                                                           # J3c: the force off (t=57)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # J4: settle (t=57-63)
   +    api  "land"                                                           # K: land (t=63)
   +    rc   2048  2048   2048    2048  0     8000      50                       # L: neutral RC through touchdown
